pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% The same inference attempted as a bare rup, with no cutting-planes step.
% This is what a student will try first, and it is expected to FAIL: asserting
% x2ge3 gives the checker a row with slack rather than an assignment to any
% individual bit, so unit propagation never reaches the constraint row.
rup 1 ~x2ge3 1 ~x3ge3 1 ~x1ge4 >= 1 ;
output NONE;
conclusion NONE;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
